                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Ok for us english speaking users this game doesn't really have any dialouge so its not really a problem. All menus are easy to navigate and are english.\nIts a wave shooter, its actually quiet fun, it cost £2.Arcadey! \nI'd pay £2 for it in an arcade and feel i've had monies worth.\nGraphics are nice and run into no frame drops.\nBut it has problems, you have to start it without steam VR even running then it will boot into the headset.\nFailing to do so will result in it crashing and not loading\nAlso at the moment it doesn't show up in the steam VR libabry but I'm sure this will get fixed.\nSound sometimes seems a little off to me but not a major problem.\nHope this helps :-)",
